        },
        {
            "+content": "We need to do it, but we just don't know how. The sexless situation that every long-term couple runs into. Daiya and Lino are a close couple: seven years dating, and five years living together. They're already like family to each other and at the point where they're both thinking about marriage. But the truth is, they've been in a sexless relationship for two whole years... Between juggling busy work schedules and missing every possible chance, the mood just never seemed to strike... So will they do it or won't they. Will they get married while still in this sexless situation, or not... A delicate but very real problem between men and women, drawn with a comic touch.",
            "+@gid": "3304199943",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
        }
